  "description": "Yun-Seul appeared in Sae-Byeok’s life for a brief moment, then disappeared like a fleeting sunshower. But mysterious circumstances have brought her back to the human world and into Sae-Byeok’s life once more. She needs to reclaim what was once hers. And in order to get it, Yun-Seul needs something from Sae-Byeok that’s more important now than ever: his love.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
